    "body": "Shouldn't color-scheme be defined in the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nGenerally proposals go to https://wiki.whatwg.org/wiki/MetaExtensions (where it's also not listed) and adopted values go in the standard itself.\r\n\r\n(Using more specific terms makes sense to me. Happy to help anyone who wants to work on that.)",
