    "created_at": "2020-03-06T16:54:17Z",
    "updated_at": "2020-03-06T16:54:17Z",
    "body": "> Shouldn't color-scheme be defined in the HTML Standard?\r\n\r\nPossibly. It was implemented and shipped by Safari before a spec was written, so capturing it all ASAP seemed important, and putting all the relevant bits together seemed reasonable. We can move it if you'd like.\r\n\r\n@fantasai's original issue is still valid, however. ^_^",
